            "tweet id": "1554065192551579649",
            "content": "being pleasant or unpleasant towards our fellow humans can considerably change the way they see us . but not always in the way we spontaneously think .",
            "time": "22-08-01 11:23",
            "timestamp": 1659324189
        },
        {
            "comment id": 1,
            "parent": 0,
            "children": [
                2
            ],
            "user id": "DentesLeo",
            "tweet id": "1554065483124690947",
            "content": "it is human nature to want to please . we all seek , to one degree or another , the approval of our fellow human beings . if only for the security it gives us : whoever is approved by his clan , by his tribe , knows he can count on their support in case of problems .",
            "time": "22-08-01 11:24",
            "timestamp": 1659324258
        },
        {
            "comment id": 2,
            "parent": 1,
            "children": [
                3
            ],
            "user id": "DentesLeo",
            "tweet id": "1554065696350511105",
            "content": "man is a fragile animal : without fangs , without horns , without claws , without scales . his protection against nature comes from the solidity and coherence of the group to which he belongs .",
            "time": "22-08-01 11:25",
            "timestamp": 1659324309
        },
        {
            "comment id": 3,
            "parent": 2,
            "children": [],
            "user id": "DentesLeo",
            "tweet id": "1554065977599467521",
            "content": "it is therefore only natural that individuals should seek to ensure the protection of the group . but this tendency can also lead us to lose ourselves .",
